01:02:12.260 --> 01:02:18.650
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ management oversight for our program by our boss Torey Malatia, who says we are not using his real talents.
<v Ira Glass>我们的节目由我们的老板托里·马拉蒂亚进行WBEZ管理监督，他说我们没有利用他的真正才华。

01:02:18.650 --> 01:02:28.480
<v John Yeosock>You know, you live your whole life learning how to dominate an enemy and all that kind of stuff. Who likes to be in charge of ensuring that diapers are available?
<v John Yeosock>你知道，你生活了一辈子学习如何统治敌人以及所有这类事情。谁喜欢负责确保提供尿布？

01:02:28.480 --> 01:02:38.440
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass, back next week with more stories of This American Life.
<v Ira Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯，下周带着更多《美国生活》的故事回来。

01:02:38.440 --> 01:02:43.440
